      <!-- Perforce: its symbol, which Logos.Perforce names for its page in the sidebar, and its logo's wordmark beside it,
           for that page's title. From the corporate logo at perforce.com/resources/brand-guidelines/logos, unchanged, in
           the logo's own units (638.98×144.22, the symbol 176.53 wide), filled nonzero. Perforce lets Claudette show them
           as those guidelines say: only in Perforce's colors (PerforceSymbolBrush, PerforceWordmarkBrush) or its black or
           white (PerforceMonoBrush), never stretched, outlined or given effects, the logo at least 110 pixels wide and the symbol 40, with clear space of half its
           height around it. The sidebar's 14-pixel symbol is smaller, as Claudette's request to Perforce described
           (DESIGN.md §14, "About"). -->
